# Business Side — Environment Configuration

**⚠️ COPY THIS TO `.env` AND FILL IN REAL VALUES. NEVER COMMIT `.env`.**

## Supabase (Island DB — separate from main build)

```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://fjkzrhyxmjtejjarlxxz.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<island-anon-key>
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<island-service-role-key>
```

## Shared API Secrets (MUST match main build's BUSINESS_SIDE_* vars)

```env
JANJEZ_MAIN_API_URL=https://janjez.social/api/business/v1
JANJEZ_MAIN_API_KEY=<same as main build BUSINESS_SIDE_API_KEY>
JANJEZ_MAIN_API_SECRET=<same as main build BUSINESS_SIDE_HMAC_SECRET>
HMAC_SECRET=<32+ char random string>
```

## M-Pesa

```env
MPESA_ENV=sandbox
MPESA_CONSUMER_KEY=<sandbox-or-prod>
MPESA_CONSUMER_SECRET=<sandbox-or-prod>
MPESA_PASSKEY=<passkey>
MPESA_SHORTCODE=<shortcode>
```

## Email (Brevo)

```env
BREVO_SMTP_HOST=<host>
BREVO_SMTP_PORT=<port>
BREVO_SMTP_USER=<user>
BREVO_SMTP_KEY=<key>
BREVO_FROM_EMAIL=<from>
BREVO_FROM_NAME=<name>
```

## Site Configuration

```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://business.janjez.social
NEXT_PUBLIC_PARTNER_HUB_DOMAIN=partners.janjez.social
SESSION_COOKIE_NAME=jez_bs_session
IDEMPOTENCY_TTL_SECONDS=86400
```

## Business Configuration

```env
PARTNER_ACTIVATION_FEE=1499
WITHDRAWAL_FEE_PERCENT=5
WITHDRAWAL_MIN_AMOUNT=500
```

## Monitoring

```env
SENTRY_DSN=<optional>
BETTER_STACK_TOKEN=<optional>
```